      "writtenOn": "2025-11-21T09:36:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could we separate this logic to its own function to avoid doing too much logic at the top level SetUp?\n\n```\nif (device \u003d\u003d nullptr) {\n    HandleDeviceCreationFailure();\n    ASSERT(gtest status is skipped or error) // I believe there is an API to do this\n    return;\n}\n```\n\nAnd it would be nice to make the logic a bit more general, maybe with a list of toggles to check and the reason of why it does a skip? Or at least a TODO to do expand when we add more reasons to make device creation failure a skip.",
      "revId": "5d8e9043115cdc6429e722758ff92171f19b6eb9",
