      "side": 1,
      "message": "We do have `Test::HasFatalFailure()` (\u003d [`testing::internal::GetUnitTestImpl()-\u003ecurrent_test_result()-\u003eHasFatalFailure()`](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/third_party/googletest/googletest/src/gtest.cc;l\u003d2759)) and `Test::IsSkipped()` checked in `Test::Run()` after calling the `SetUp` ([1]), but they are member of `testing::Test`, and currently `DawnTestBase` don\u0027t have reference to `testing::Test` (we use both `DawnTestBase` and `::testing::TestWithParam` as the base of `DawnTestWithParams`) so maybe we have to add a pointer of `testing::Test` in `DawnTestBase`.\n\n[1]: https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/third_party/googletest/googletest/src/gtest.cc;l\u003d2744",
